Note on the code vs the data it produces:

This MIT license covers the CODE in this repository. It does not cover any data
the code fetches. Train schedules are retrieved from India's National Train
Enquiry System (NTES) via an unofficial client; the schedules are public factual
information, but bulk collection and redistribution may be subject to the
operator's terms of use. Station coordinates and track geometry are derived from
OpenStreetMap, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, licensed under the Open Database
License (ODbL) — see https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright. Use responsibly.
